{
  "$comment": "QuickSheet curation for the core content profile. Selects which Old Gus SRD records are imported and records QuickSheet's structured reading of each feature's mechanics. Every imported class/ancestry/community feature, subclass Foundation feature, domain card and gear feature MUST have an entry; the importer fails otherwise. Subclass Specialization/Mastery features without an entry default to 'deferred' (see defaults). kind: 'effects' = implemented by one or more effect properties (modifiers, resource, attack, flags, grants, resolver, companion, display); 'reference' = situational/at-table effect with no generation-time numbers; 'deferred' = needs progression support (V2) and must never be acquired by the generator. Modifier values: a number, 'proficiency', 'level', or 'halfUp:<trait>' (half the effective trait, rounded up, minimum 0). Resource counts: 'tier', 'level', 'proficiency', 'trait:<trait>' or 'trait:spellcast'.",
